{"id":"n7e09a984e2","headline":"Albanese warns fuel crisis from Iran war to hit Australia for months | The Jerusalem Post","summary":"Australia imports about 90% of its fuel, and petrol prices have surged with localised shortages due to the US-Israeli war on Iran and the Strait of Hormuz blockade. The prime minister warned the impact could last months.","why":"Australia relies heavily on imported refined fuel, so disruptions in Gulf shipping quickly feed into domestic petrol prices, inflation and household costs.","category":"economy","event_type":"energy-supply","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Canberra","country":"Australia","lat":-35.28,"lon":149.13,"region":"oc"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Jerusalem Post | JPost.com","url":"https://www.jpost.com/international/article-891883"},"sources":[{"name":"The Jerusalem Post | JPost.com","url":"https://www.jpost.com/international/article-891883"}],"published_at":"2026-04-01T11:21:05Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T17:30:28Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"475bd168ee034b6a","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T17:30:28Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-04-01T11:21:05Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-04-01T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"AS","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/oil-refinery-109025.jpg","alt":"oil refinery (illustration)","credit":"jpenrose","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/refinery-oil-aerial-natural-gas-109025/"}}